# The pause menu must be reachable from EVERY phase a player can be sitting in. The main menu is the
# only screen carrying an Exit button, so a phase Escape does not answer is a phase from which the
# game cannot be quit at all.
#
# This covers the two phases BEFORE the world opens, which is where the gap was: childhood
# reminescence swallowed Escape outright. It was untestable as well as broken, because the CLI kept
# its own simplified copy of the rule ("anything that is not the menu opens the menu") — so `pause`
# reported a working pause menu in a phase where the key did nothing. `pause` now calls the same
# HandleEscape the launcher's key hook does, which is what makes this script an assertion about
# Escape rather than about a paraphrase of it.
#
# Deliberately NO --skip-childhood: this script is about the phases that flag skips over.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --silent --no-save

wait
click menu New

# ── Protagonist creation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not a running phase, but a screen a player can be stuck on for a long time. Pausing must cost
# nothing: the allocation lives on the protagonist, not in the renderer, so Continue rebuilds the
# same screen rather than dropping into the world.
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
pause
wait mode MainMenu 20
expect-state menu Continue enabled
click menu Continue
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20

# ── Childhood reminescence ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The reported bug: Escape did nothing here at all.
click continue
wait mode ChildhoodReminescence 90
pause
wait mode MainMenu 20

# And the other half of it — resuming must return to childhood rather than to the world, and must
# RESUME it rather than rebuild it. MenuReturnMode read a flat LocationInteraction for all three
# narrative phases, and OnEnterChildhoodReminescence built a second scene on every entry, which
# together would have restarted childhood from its first reminescence.
click menu Continue
wait mode ChildhoodReminescence 30

quit
